      "description": "Come on, just admit it. You haven’t had french toast in a while and you want it now. This is the perfect excuse to get that cinnamon-y, semi-crunchy, delicious taste.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n6 large eggs\n2/3 cup almond flour\n¼ cup peanut butter\n¼ cup heavy whipping cream\n¼ cup crushed toasted almonds\n2 tablespoons coconut oil\n1 tablespoon unsalted butter\n2 tablespoons erythritol\n1 teaspoon cinnamon\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n½ teaspoon of salt\n¼ teaspoon nutmeg\n10 drops liquid Stevia\n\nNutrition Summary:\nPer muffin, you’ll be looking at: 182.81 Calories, 15.15g Fats, 2.5g Net Carbs, and 7.03g Protein.\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 30 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
